00:12:27.080 --> 00:12:28.520
I've got a bad feeling.

00:12:28.520 --> 00:12:29.850
Sora!

00:12:35.490 --> 00:12:37.190
What is it? What's going on?

00:12:37.190 --> 00:12:39.630
It couldn't be a bank robbery, could it?

00:12:39.630 --> 00:12:41.390
No way.

00:12:58.810 --> 00:13:00.480
Hand over the money quietly!

00:13:00.480 --> 00:13:04.020
Don't underestimate me.
I'm the unluckiest man in the world!

00:13:04.020 --> 00:13:04.850
Kate!

00:13:04.850 --> 00:13:05.720
Jerry?

00:13:05.720 --> 00:13:07.090
Mr. Policeman! Ken!

00:13:07.090 --> 00:13:09.260
Policeman? Really?!

00:13:09.260 --> 00:13:12.120
Really. Now, let go of Kate.

00:13:15.100 --> 00:13:16.400
You've got to be kidding!

00:13:16.400 --> 00:13:20.670
Dammit, my first bank robbery ever
and there's a policeman?!

00:13:20.670 --> 00:13:23.300
I really am the unluckiest man in the world!

00:13:23.300 --> 00:13:26.570
You guys! Now you get that I'm telling
the truth, don't you?

00:13:26.570 --> 00:13:28.040
I'm serious!

00:13:28.040 --> 00:13:30.040
Everybody on the second floor,
you come down here too!

00:13:30.040 --> 00:13:32.410
Hey, you, tie the policeman up with this!

00:13:32.410 --> 00:13:34.250
What? Me?

00:13:34.250 --> 00:13:35.750
Yeah, hurry up!

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:36.650
Yes, sir.

00:13:36.650 --> 00:13:39.820
Tie him tightly. I'm gonna check up
on you afterwards.

00:13:39.820 --> 00:13:43.590
If there's not enough rope,
there's plenty more in my bag.

00:13:43.590 --> 00:13:47.320
Preparation is the one thing I'm good at.
My grandma always praised me for it.

00:13:47.460 --> 00:13:49.260
I'm sorry, Mr. Policeman.

00:13:49.260 --> 00:13:51.930
If we pull any stupid tricks, you'll be in danger.

00:13:51.930 --> 00:13:54.090
You can tie it tightly.

00:13:55.900 --> 00:13:56.840
It's a patrol car.

00:13:56.840 --> 00:13:57.870
You're kidding!

00:13:57.870 --> 00:14:01.240
If you guys contact the police you'll be sorry!

00:14:01.240 --> 00:14:03.140
Aw, man, am I closing the barn door too late?

00:14:03.140 --> 00:14:04.650
Even if they don't report everything,

00:14:04.650 --> 00:14:08.420
the inside of this bank is set up
so it can be constantly monitored.

00:14:08.420 --> 00:14:09.450
Really?!

00:14:09.450 --> 00:14:11.320
I didn't know that.

00:14:11.320 --> 00:14:13.650
That's just what you'd expect from me.

00:14:13.650 --> 00:14:15.020
I really am the unluckiest man in the world.

00:14:17.120 --> 00:14:19.420
Looks like it really is a bank robbery.

00:14:20.260 --> 00:14:21.660
Sora...

00:14:21.660 --> 00:14:26.100
Attention, criminal! Release the hostages
quietly and come out!

00:14:26.100 --> 00:14:29.260
Everything that happens in there
is being watched on our monitors!

00:14:31.170 --> 00:14:33.640
It looks like all of the hostages are safe.

00:14:33.640 --> 00:14:35.810
If you stop now, your crimes are still light.

00:14:35.810 --> 00:14:37.780
You might be dissatisfied about some things
in this world, but so are we!

00:14:37.780 --> 00:14:38.650
Well?

00:14:37.780 --> 00:14:38.650
You might be dissatisfied about some things
in this world, but so are we!

00:14:38.650 --> 00:14:39.310
Can you see?

00:14:38.650 --> 00:14:39.310
You might be dissatisfied about some things
in this world, but so are we!

00:14:39.310 --> 00:14:39.410
Can you see?

00:14:39.410 --> 00:14:40.380
Yeah.

00:14:39.410 --> 00:14:40.380
Do you know how little pocket money
my wife lets me have each day?

00:14:40.380 --> 00:14:41.220
Sort of.

00:14:40.380 --> 00:14:41.220
Do you know how little pocket money
my wife lets me have each day?

00:14:41.220 --> 00:14:42.320
Do you know how little pocket money
my wife lets me have each day?

00:14:42.320 --> 00:14:42.850
It's really...

00:14:42.850 --> 00:14:43.680
There they are!

00:14:42.850 --> 00:14:43.680
It's really...

00:14:43.680 --> 00:14:43.820
There they are!

00:14:43.680 --> 00:14:43.820
It's not a number I can say in front of people!

00:14:43.820 --> 00:14:45.790
Sora and Ken are both okay!

00:14:43.820 --> 00:14:45.790
It's not a number I can say in front of people!

00:14:46.850 --> 00:14:48.460
Jeez.

00:14:48.460 --> 00:14:51.230
The world's full of phonies!

00:14:51.230 --> 00:14:53.660
I'm always at a disadvantage.

00:14:53.660 --> 00:14:57.530
But I was supposed to stop
feeling like that today.

00:14:58.130 --> 00:15:00.870
I wanted money to make my dream come true.

00:15:00.870 --> 00:15:04.540
It doesn't have to be a fortune.
My dream's a small one.

00:15:04.540 --> 00:15:08.880
Go to a country with a low cost of living
and no phonies,

00:15:08.880 --> 00:15:12.380
meet a woman who doesn't call me a blockhead,

00:15:12.380 --> 00:15:15.710
and get hold of a little bit of happiness.

00:15:16.080 --> 00:15:18.590
Why doesn't a tiny dream like that
come true?! Huh?!

00:15:18.590 --> 00:15:20.790
Is it me?! Is it my fault?!

00:15:20.790 --> 00:15:21.820
What do you think?

00:15:21.820 --> 00:15:23.220
I'm not sure.

00:15:23.220 --> 00:15:24.360
Do you have a dream?

00:15:24.360 --> 00:15:25.530
Yes...

00:15:25.530 --> 00:15:27.590
Does it look like it'll come true?

00:15:28.060 --> 00:15:31.000
It'll come true. I'll make it come true.

00:15:31.000 --> 00:15:33.270
You're pretty sure of yourself.

00:15:33.270 --> 00:15:34.870
What kind of a dream is it?

00:15:34.870 --> 00:15:38.410
To create a Kaleido Stage
where everyone can smile!

00:15:38.410 --> 00:15:40.340
Kaleido Stage?

00:15:40.340 --> 00:15:42.940
Are you one of the Kaleido Stage cast?

00:15:42.940 --> 00:15:45.040
That's just a phony show!

00:15:45.610 --> 00:15:45.950
Phony?!

00:15:45.950 --> 00:15:46.680
What do you mean by phony?

00:15:45.950 --> 00:15:46.680
Phony?!

00:15:46.680 --> 00:15:47.740
What do you mean by phony?

00:15:48.750 --> 00:15:51.190
The Kaleido Stage isn't phony!

00:15:51.190 --> 00:15:53.590
So you're from Kaleido Stage too?

00:15:53.590 --> 00:15:56.220
I'm not gonna get taken in by phonies anymore!

00:15:56.220 --> 00:16:00.130
I'm going to doubt everything that's unbelievable
and live life on the winning side.

00:16:00.130 --> 00:16:01.830
I don't believe anything I don't see
with my own eyes.

00:16:01.830 --> 00:16:05.130
I've been reborn as a man with a heart of steel!

00:16:05.130 --> 00:16:06.500
I'll show you, then.

00:16:06.500 --> 00:16:07.500
Show me what?

00:16:07.500 --> 00:16:08.500
Wait, Sora!

00:16:08.500 --> 00:16:09.500
Hey, Sora...

00:16:09.500 --> 00:16:11.570
I'll give you a performance here and now.

00:16:11.570 --> 00:16:12.570
Here and now?

00:16:12.570 --> 00:16:14.740
Sora, now's not the time for that!

00:16:14.740 --> 00:16:15.640
He's right, Sora.

00:16:15.640 --> 00:16:18.580
I'm talking to this girl about dreams right now!

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:20.720
Don't butt in!

00:16:20.720 --> 00:16:24.990
You said your dream was to
make everyone smile, didn't you?

00:16:24.990 --> 00:16:25.820
Yes.

00:16:25.820 --> 00:16:31.460
Then make me smile. Me, the man
with the steel heart.

00:16:31.460 --> 00:16:33.220
All right.

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:39.630
Whoa! That's amazing!

00:16:41.540 --> 00:16:42.700
I'm borrowing your rope.

00:16:42.700 --> 00:16:43.690
Uh, go ahead.

00:16:46.940 --> 00:16:49.810
Now then, please sit back and watch
through to the end.

00:16:49.810 --> 00:16:50.640
Okay.

00:16:54.650 --> 00:16:57.050
...and what do you think my
daughter's boyfriend called me?

00:16:57.890 --> 00:16:59.180
Hey, what's this?

00:16:59.720 --> 00:17:00.550
What is it?

00:17:00.550 --> 00:17:01.690
Sora is...

00:17:01.690 --> 00:17:03.120
...doing a show.

00:17:03.990 --> 00:17:05.730
I wanna see! I wanna see!
I wanna see! I wanna see!

00:17:05.730 --> 00:17:08.500
I wanna see! I wanna see! I wanna see!
I wanna see!

00:17:08.500 --> 00:17:12.330
So Mia, which bank is it?
I have to hurry or it'll be over!

00:17:12.500 --> 00:17:13.630
Hey, come to think of it...

00:17:15.600 --> 00:17:17.570
Is that a smile?

00:17:18.810 --> 00:17:20.270
You're done?

00:17:21.180 --> 00:17:22.410
Come in.

00:17:22.410 --> 00:17:24.010
I thought you'd be here!

00:17:24.010 --> 00:17:27.080
You've been coming here every day lately,
so I figured you might be!

00:17:27.080 --> 00:17:28.080
What do you want?

00:17:28.080 --> 00:17:31.490
Mia called me and said Sora's doing
a police drama at a bank

00:17:31.490 --> 00:17:34.120
and it's on TV and they're shooting right now!

00:17:34.120 --> 00:17:36.020
Come on, wanna go watch?

00:17:36.020 --> 00:17:37.930
I can't tell what she's talking about.

00:17:37.930 --> 00:17:40.160
Well, if we go we'll figure it out.

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:42.830
There's no point in doing any more
today anyway.

00:17:42.830 --> 00:17:45.630
Please wait! I'll keep trying! Miss Layla...

00:17:45.630 --> 00:17:46.670
Let's go.

00:17:46.670 --> 00:17:47.670
All right.

00:17:47.670 --> 00:17:49.260
You come too, May!

00:17:50.770 --> 00:17:53.570
Oh, I'm so sorry, thank you so much
for driving me there too!

00:17:53.570 --> 00:17:56.680
That really wasn't my intention
when I told you about it, I swear!

00:17:56.680 --> 00:17:59.740
Oh, no, the more the merrier.
Although it's a bit cramped.

00:18:09.790 --> 00:18:12.260
Right now, this is my stage.

00:18:12.430 --> 00:18:18.060
For the people who are watching me,
and for that man, I'll give it my all!

00:18:20.470 --> 00:18:21.760
Sora!

00:18:22.540 --> 00:18:24.200
Oh, wow!

00:18:28.210 --> 00:18:30.340
It's really not rigged?

00:18:31.710 --> 00:18:35.980
Everyone's made me remember what it
feels like to be the audience.

00:18:35.980 --> 00:18:37.650
More than the amazing performances,

00:18:37.650 --> 00:18:40.620
it was the way everyone onstage
looked like they had so much fun

00:18:40.620 --> 00:18:44.610
that was the biggest reason I fell in love
with Kaleido Stage.

00:18:48.730 --> 00:18:52.930
After I understood that my mom and dad
weren't ever coming back,

00:18:52.930 --> 00:18:58.110
somehow before I knew it I was always
thinking about Kaleido Stage.

00:18:58.110 --> 00:19:02.680
That was because I felt like if
I went to Kaleido Stage,

00:19:02.680 --> 00:19:05.240
I could have fun again like I did that time.

00:19:08.050 --> 00:19:09.640
She'll fall!

00:19:12.590 --> 00:19:14.710
You just smiled, didn't you.

00:19:15.720 --> 00:19:18.020
Looks like Sora won this one.

00:19:19.390 --> 00:19:20.960
Looks like it.

00:19:20.960 --> 00:19:24.450
Do you know why Sora worked so hard for you?

00:19:24.870 --> 00:19:29.300
Naturally, one reason was to prove
that Kaleido Stage isn't phony.

00:19:29.300 --> 00:19:32.610
But the other one was that Sora
wants you to get your smile back.

00:19:32.610 --> 00:19:34.730
No, not just you.

00:19:34.980 --> 00:19:36.740
She wants all the people who
watch her show to smile,

00:19:36.740 --> 00:19:41.200
and all the people who perform
onstage with her too.

00:19:41.750 --> 00:19:44.050
You know, I want to create a Kaleido Stage

00:19:44.050 --> 00:19:47.020
where the audience and the cast
can all have fun.

00:19:47.520 --> 00:19:49.990
I like it when people smile.

00:19:50.790 --> 00:19:55.060
Sure, that's a tough dream to make happen,
but Sora thinks she can do it.

00:19:55.060 --> 00:19:57.000
That's why she works so hard.

00:19:57.000 --> 00:19:58.330
For her dream, huh?

00:19:58.330 --> 00:20:02.200
That's why I've decided to try working a
little for my dream too.

00:20:02.800 --> 00:20:04.100
You too?

00:20:04.100 --> 00:20:07.700
I'm going to propose to that woman.

00:20:09.010 --> 00:20:12.000
My dream's as small as yours, huh?

00:20:12.910 --> 00:20:14.820
Mine isn't a dream.

00:20:14.820 --> 00:20:17.950
I was just a loser looking for place to escape to.

00:20:17.950 --> 00:20:19.920
Start all over again.

00:20:19.920 --> 00:20:21.260
Yeah, that's what I'll do.

00:20:21.260 --> 00:20:22.120
Then...

00:20:22.120 --> 00:20:24.220
Hold it. I'll leave by myself.

00:20:24.220 --> 00:20:27.460
I'm not the one you really have to catch, right?

00:20:31.100 --> 00:20:33.790
Hey! You can stop, I get it.

00:20:34.540 --> 00:20:38.200
I take back what I said about it
being phony. I'm sorry.

00:20:38.910 --> 00:20:40.170
You mean...

00:20:40.170 --> 00:20:43.300
It was fun. Thanks.

00:20:45.780 --> 00:20:49.110
Next time, please come to see
the show at Kaleido Stage!

00:20:49.520 --> 00:20:50.720
Sure.

00:20:50.720 --> 00:20:53.150
It's over already? What a shame.

00:20:53.150 --> 00:20:55.290
But still, it was a good show.

00:20:55.290 --> 00:20:56.790
That was great, Sora!

00:20:55.290 --> 00:20:56.790
Yay Sora!

00:20:56.790 --> 00:20:58.090
Sora!

00:20:58.090 --> 00:21:00.690
Sora's as great as ever.

00:21:00.690 --> 00:21:03.530
It hurts, but her moves were definitely good.

00:21:03.530 --> 00:21:05.570
And she wasn't even onstage...

00:21:05.570 --> 00:21:08.870
What does Sora have that I don't have?

00:21:08.870 --> 00:21:11.930
Oh, thank you, thank you.

00:21:12.710 --> 00:21:15.340
It feels like back when we were kids, huh?

00:21:15.340 --> 00:21:20.080
Wonder Kate rescued Crybaby Jerry
all the time when he got bullied.

00:21:20.610 --> 00:21:23.780
I built up my body because I didn't like
the way I was then, but...

00:21:23.780 --> 00:21:26.550
Jerry, your good point is your kindness.

00:21:26.550 --> 00:21:28.090
Kate...

00:21:28.090 --> 00:21:29.950
What?

00:21:31.460 --> 00:21:34.660
I want to put you under eternal arrest!

00:21:39.670 --> 00:21:42.430
Happy thirtieth birthday!

00:21:43.640 --> 00:21:46.870
I'll arrest you too.

00:21:53.110 --> 00:21:55.510
KATE!

00:22:03.090 --> 00:22:07.960
It looks like right now, the stage is still
the only thing that captivates Sora.

00:22:09.230 --> 00:22:11.430
What Sagittarius wants...

00:22:11.430 --> 00:22:15.170
A stage with no battling, colored only by smiles.

00:22:15.170 --> 00:22:18.670
It's an extremely foolish dream.

00:22:18.670 --> 00:22:21.680
It's foolish, therefore it's a path
no one dares to walk.

00:22:21.680 --> 00:22:25.180
What awaits at the end is either applause...

00:22:25.180 --> 00:22:27.250
or scorn.

00:22:27.250 --> 00:22:29.080
One of those two.

