00:23:49.160 --> 00:23:53.800
Whatever it is Sora's got that I don't...
It hurts, but I'll find out what that is for sure!

00:23:53.800 --> 00:23:56.970
A great performance with May
at Mr. Kenneth's event!

00:23:56.970 --> 00:23:58.870
